Cargo.lock

# Debug files
**/*.rs.bk
*.pdb

# Throwaway measurement harnesses.
#
# Nearly every change in this project is measured before and after by running
# a few worlds for tens of thousands of ticks and reading numbers off them.
# Those harnesses have to live in examples/ for cargo to build them, they are
# rewritten for each question, and none of them is worth keeping: the numbers
# go into SIMULATION_AUDIT.md and ISSUES_FOUND.md, and the harness goes in the
# bin.
examples/_debug_*.rs

